WEBVTT

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:08.445
Explore confirmed exoplanets using NASA archive data.

00:00:08.445 --> 00:00:15.465
Switch the discovery chart to cumulative discoveries.

00:00:15.465 --> 00:00:22.045
Compare planetary sizes and orbits in another analysis view.

00:00:22.045 --> 00:00:29.323
Explore habitability estimates. These are model estimates, not evidence of life.

00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:36.830
Narrow the discovery-year range. Filters update the charts and totals.
